@startuml
actor User
participant "CRM client" as Client
participant "Google registration" as Registration
database "SQL Server" as Database

note over Client: Google sign-in returned registrationRequired
User -> Client: Submit registration form
Client -> Registration: POST /api/auth/google/register
Registration -> Database: Load valid registration continuation
Registration -> Database: Consume continuation and save account, link and session
Database --> Registration: Transaction committed
Registration --> Client: 201 signedIn
@enduml
